any-sync-bundle is a prepackaged, all-in-one self-hosted server for Anytype,
a local-first privacy-focused alternative to Notion. It merges all official
Anytype sync modules (coordinator, consensus, filenode, sync) into a single
binary for simplified deployment.

Requires: MongoDB (with replica set), Redis (with RedisBloom module).

WWW: https://github.com/grishy/any-sync-bundle
